  <div class="pop-rewards__faqs pop-page-width">
    <h2>FAQs</h2>

    <div class="faqs-container">
      <details name="faq">
        <summary>What is {{ popLoyaltyName }}?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          {{ popLoyaltyName }} is a loyalty program offered by Indus Valley Organic. To access the benefits of the
          program, you must log in to the program through https://www.buyindusvalley.in/.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>What are {{ popCurrency  }}?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          {{ popCurrency  }} is a currency that allows you to access exclusive offers and discounts when you shop on Indus Valley
          Organic. You can earn and redeem {{ popCurrency  }} not only on Indus Valley Organic but also on other partner brands
          that are part of the {{ popCurrency  }} program.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>Is there a membership fee for {{ popLoyaltyName }}?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          No, there is no membership fee to participate in the {{ popLoyaltyName }}. All you need to do is click on the
          rewards program and join the program.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>How many {{ popCurrency  }} do I get for shopping on Indus Valley Organic?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          You will receive 5 {{ popCurrency  }} for every Rs. 100 spent on Indus Valley Organic. For instance, if you purchase a
          product for Rs. 1000, you will earn 50 {{ popCurrency  }}. Once your order is delivered, the {{ popCurrency  }} will be credited
          to your account after the return period (if any) has ended. Once the {{ popCurrency  }} are credited, you can redeem
          them immediately. However, please note that you will not earn any {{ popCurrency  }} for reward purchases.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>What is the validity period for {{ popCurrency  }}?</summary>

        <p class="content">{{ popCurrency  }} are valid for 1 year from the date they are credited to your account.</p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>Is it possible to cancel rewards redeemed with {{ popCurrency  }}?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          No, once you have redeemed rewards using {{ popCurrency  }}, it is not possible to reverse the transaction.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>
          Is it possible to use {{ popCurrency  }} as the sole payment method for shopping on Indus Valley Organic?
        </summary>

        <p class="content">
          No, it is not possible to use {{ popCurrency  }} for the entire purchase amount. {{ popCurrency  }} can only be used to get a
          discount on a certain value of the cart, and the discount percentage is available on our website.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>When will {{ popCurrency  }} be credited to my account after purchase?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          Once your order is delivered, the {{ popCurrency  }} will be credited to your account after the return period (if any)
          has ended.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>What happens to the {{ popCurrency  }} used for a purchase if I cancel or return the order?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          If you cancel the order, the {{ popCurrency  }} used for the purchase will be credited back to your account immediately.
          If you return the product, the {{ popCurrency  }} used for the purchase will be credited to your account once the
          product has passed the quality check and the return has been approved.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>
          If I cancel the order, will the {{ popCurrency  }} that were to be credited to my account also be cancelled?
        </summary>

        <p class="content">Yes, the {{ popCurrency  }} that you were supposed to earn will be revoked for the cancelled order.</p>
      </details>

      <details name="faq">
        <summary>Where can I check the details of my {{ popCurrency  }}?</summary>

        <p class="content">
          To view the details of your {{ popCurrency  }}, please follow these easy steps on the Indus Valley Organic website: Log
          in to Indus Valley Organic Rewards. Navigate to the bottom of the page and click on the "Check History"
          button. This will take you to the coins history page, where you can check the status of your {{ popCurrency  }},
          including whether they are 'on the way,' 'credited,' 'redeemed,' or 'expired.'
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
